    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/6/desc",
    "source": "A barbarian who channels giantkind, growing to their size and hurling what comes to hand.",
    "sourceHash": "11d2e2056f81bf5b0a13bd028b5c85198d39201dcc2594ca10674fdf06194082"
  },
  {
    "id": "d15293645d083ad8bee5",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/6/levels/3/0/n",
    "source": "Giant's Power",
    "sourceHash": "264e8ac41f09e1f6c5582add738115370540fe20a0b5ca9352b57ce11e72ea5d"
  },
  {
    "id": "ddb82ca64b39d7b19966",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/6/levels/3/0/d",
    "source": "You learn to speak, read and write Giant, or another language if you already know it, and you learn your choice of the druidcraft or thaumaturgy cantrip, cast with Wisdom.",
    "sourceHash": "7bc258add05f043da82015decd4634e9d829912b40b1ea59dedcda577ae69f8f"
  },
  {
    "id": "649cb8243f8949de5fda",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/6/levels/3/1/n",
    "source": "Giant's Havoc",
    "sourceHash": "86dce7324a224276756b77e99991b452b76d22a957626f4c432c238232318bb3"
  },
  {
    "id": "de9fd458e0777262fcb6",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/6/levels/3/1/d",
    "source": "While raging you gain Crushing Throw (a thrown weapon attack that hits using Strength adds your Rage damage bonus) and Giant Stature (your reach grows by 5 feet, and if you are smaller than Large you become Large, with what you carry, if there is room).",
    "sourceHash": "3687cdbbad355a68e06ff4f9cac4c272cfaae3a97e9a8a90dc33cdac6b8b8334"
  },
  {
    "id": "efecf2869a9dee19db8d",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/6/levels/6/0/n",
    "source": "Elemental Cleaver",
    "sourceHash": "170c9590f9ccc5a62e7d65519f26bc23feccf016faa50e590c93db16cc2822a5"
  },
  {
    "id": "d21c65fe349a4b13a2ca",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/6/levels/6/0/d",
    "source": "When you enter your rage, infuse one weapon you hold with acid, cold, fire, lightning or thunder until the rage ends: its damage becomes that type, it deals an extra 1d6 damage of it, and it gains the thrown property (20/60), returning to your hand after a throw. Its benefits do not work for anyone else, and a bonus action changes the element.",
    "sourceHash": "531c22e0e8c2e4ee58179e1ae2893350e0a0acaea3135676d0eeafaebeed459b"
  },
  {
    "id": "51d0074df2e3d9d9ae09",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/6/levels/10/0/n",
    "source": "Mighty Impel",
    "sourceHash": "42cec14cd68c5eff879717049ff371719c5cfa402ae3004b0c1bf356816a57f5"
  },
  {
    "id": "7b5eda4f412cf83e2958",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/6/levels/10/0/d",
    "source": "As a bonus action while raging, choose a Medium or smaller creature within your reach and move it to an unoccupied space you can see within 30 feet of you; an unwilling creature avoids this with a Strength save (DC 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Strength modifier). A creature left in the air falls and lands prone.",
    "sourceHash": "da80efdc6c547a37bb566023c12ca88df38ae87ba434d01eecee17f8a4a7b68d"
  },
  {
    "id": "3d62c146ce056fc8af76",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/6/levels/14/0/n",
    "source": "Demiurgic Colossus",
    "sourceHash": "d86d0c713496c3409e3a2c2c6cd6d727f8473a9f845d8a5af2c2d011ed93219e"
  },
  {
    "id": "01ff64440373fd36a3c0",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/barbarian/6/levels/14/0/d",
    "source": "When you rage, your reach grows by 10 feet, you can become Large or Huge (your choice) if there is room, Mighty Impel can move Large or smaller creatures, and Elemental Cleaver's extra damage becomes 2d6.",
    "sourceHash": "bb879bb8d6868f822ca793b9b869528e42311912f54c465e46212de6eaa0e001"
  },
  {
