    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/bard/1/desc",
    "source": "Feywild-touched charm: this bard rescues allies with a word and commands rooms on presence alone.",
    "sourceHash": "e06ec42def45f6cbc07a8216130c80520bae0063a08e2c438dd1034cf8089af2"
  },
  {
    "id": "a460c0020ac98c09bb4a",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/bard/1/levels/3/0/n",
    "source": "Mantle of Inspiration",
    "sourceHash": "a32e4ac0bb27d6d05a1867b17de2873e5d92f7dd99e5cc7851f7ad71d799e555"
  },
  {
    "id": "e6da3ac922ae2f56235a",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/bard/1/levels/3/0/d",
    "source": "As a bonus action, spend one Bardic Inspiration: a number of creatures you can see within 60 feet equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum one) each gain 5 temporary hit points (8 at 5th level, 11 at 10th, 14 at 15th) and can use a reaction to move up to their speed without provoking opportunity attacks.",
    "sourceHash": "e4816d17426be7d97fb14a13efb7a372b9246a7188c7ea65617563935166e890"
  },
  {
    "id": "019288e906e0ae734580",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/bard/1/levels/3/1/n",
    "source": "Enthralling Performance",
    "sourceHash": "f6159dd9effd24bdf3093f0677803b795c3ed5af7690a243e1c04fd81fea0819"
  },
  {
    "id": "0cf1269a46497fabcafa",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/bard/1/levels/3/1/d",
    "source": "After performing for at least a minute, choose a number of humanoids within 60 feet who watched and listened to all of it equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum one); each makes a Wisdom save against your spell save DC or is charmed by you for an hour, idolizing you and hindering anyone who opposes you. Once per short or long rest.",
    "sourceHash": "0be7f76ab0fddc98143152ba9bc925f4e8870a4cea34790bf26a4650571caf07"
  },
  {
    "id": "3bd396e87f3c32ab5aff",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/bard/1/levels/6/0/n",
    "source": "Mantle of Majesty",
    "sourceHash": "6ced70cc0abe76f21e10dd51c52a48ef97d49f6f39d33478cfc9def302eb5d2b"
  },
  {
    "id": "00f1ccc996a93c49bebd",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/bard/1/levels/6/0/d",
    "source": "As a bonus action you cast command without a spell slot and take on an unearthly majesty for a minute (concentration). On each of your turns while it lasts you can cast command again as a bonus action without a slot, and a creature charmed by you automatically fails its save against it. Once per long rest.",
    "sourceHash": "2f1d6a53c9e0e78dbae568802e5261e43b9dbe21f0551962ffe7a0f46ac7a108"
  },
  {
    "id": "d189b5b05827eb0d1b14",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/bard/1/levels/14/0/n",
    "source": "Unbreakable Majesty",
    "sourceHash": "6d2ab3af49e35e7c8870261adf4134cb674e9c1adbbdda3a0842c238086cdb46"
  },
  {
    "id": "6f803fa72049fe45f6a3",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/bard/1/levels/14/0/d",
    "source": "A bonus action makes you awesome to behold for a minute: an attacker must pass a Charisma save or lose the attack and be unable to target you that turn.",
    "sourceHash": "9bd9ce73cfe391e25a3d9acc49ad9b9d873df37d76573eb29ff16decd11da06d"
  },
